WEBVTT

00:25:30.079 --> 00:25:32.496
people would come up after a talk and say,

00:25:33.288 --> 00:25:34.788
I already knew everything you said.

00:25:35.454 --> 00:25:38.246
I had no words for it and I
thought it was just me.

00:25:40.579 --> 00:25:45.163
And so that's that's the goal of the
work to give people language,

00:25:45.454 --> 00:25:49.413
language is power. And and here's the myth
. Here's what I tell people.

00:25:51.496 --> 00:25:52.496
We think.

00:25:53.663 --> 00:25:59.913
That giving language to hard
emotions like shame,